OL,3,GNEWSAResident doctors begin 24-hour
OL,4,Astrike over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident doctors have returned to the
OL,7,Fpicket lines on Friday in a strike over
OL,8,Fpay.
OL,10,FThey are holding a full 24-hour strike
OL,11,Fwhich began at 07:00 GMT, marking their
OL,12,Fsecond such action this year.
OL,14,FBritish Medical Association (BMA)
OL,15,Fmembers voted in favour of industrial
OL,16,Faction after the union rejected a
OL,17,Frecommended 3.5% pay rise from an
OL,18,Findependent pay body.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
