OL,3,GNEWSAResident doctors begin 24-hour
OL,4,Astrike over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Minister Robbie Butler said he
OL,7,Fremained committed to delivering the
OL,8,Fpay award and that he would "do
OL,9,Feverything in my power" to implement it
OL,10,Fthis year - but said he was unable to
OL,11,Fdo so in the absence of a Stormont
OL,12,Fbudget.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
